sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Coding agent (MCP client)
    participant Server as suite-gate mcp
    participant Tool as Audit tool
    Agent->>Server: list tools
    Server-->>Agent: gate, git_surface, trust_path, ... (all read-only)
    Agent->>Server: call gate {repo, base, ref}, or one tool
    Server->>Tool: run with --audit-json (argument list, no shell)
    Tool-->>Server: audit-result/1 object, exit status
    Server->>Server: validate the object, check tool name and exit status
    alt the object is valid
        Server-->>Agent: structuredContent + JSON text, isError false (findings included)
    else missing tool, bad argument, invalid object or timeout
        Server-->>Agent: isError true, one line of text
    end
